{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064811/block/singleImage/3273062/df/01M7VBP3JZKVAQJNQ43X9RT7G2.jpg?updatedAt=1795140833\"/><figcaption>山頂盧吉道</figcaption></figure><p>男子在山頂獨自飲酒及拍照，疑飲醉後墮2米高山坡，腳部受傷。 男子拒絕送院 據了解，事主為26歲印度籍男子，持香港身份證。警方昨晚近10時半接獲一名女子報案，指一名男子從山頂盧吉道欄杆墮下斜坡。男子當時在盧吉道一處約2米高的山坡大石上獨自飲酒，疑飲醉跌落對下行人路。消防接報趕至現場拯救，事主登上救護車接受初步檢查後，拒絕送院。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:43:53.620161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:53:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T01:17:12.330034+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:15.946290+00:00","content_hash":"f379a6c9e68d71e287dcce9ff4b7482a7eef4ee7f069195c7dad3f605077499b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:43:53.620161+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}